{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:9afb9b00694dd85d","name":"Privateer Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-9afb9b00694dd85d","title":"Privateer Talent Tree","revision":19543,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:09:45Z","sha256":"58b8a049afc1ba4b867a299112a8ef1415477bf079bc7a3c6e56bdfa8823f5c0","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19543","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Privateer%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-9afb9b00694dd85d","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are a veteran of privateering and have learned the secrets of fighting aboard ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships"},".\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Armored Spacer"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You can use ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armored Space Suits"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armored_Space_Suits"}," as if you had the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor Proficiency (Heavy)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor_Proficiency_(Heavy)","referenceId":"reference:7773896a63cadb7f"}," feat.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Attract Privateer"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You attract a loyal Privateer Lieutenant. The Lieutenant is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonheroic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonheroic","referenceId":"reference:1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3"}," character who has a Class Level equal to three-quarters of your Character Level, rounded down. \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can select this Talent multiple times. Each time you do so, you gain another ",{"tag":"b","children":["Privateer"]},". Each ",{"tag":"b","children":["Privateer"]}," who accompanies you on an adventure is entitled to an equal share of the total ",{"tag":"a","children":["Experience Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Experience_Points"}," earned for the adventure. For example, a ",{"tag":"b","children":["Privateer"]}," who accompanies a party of five heroes on an adventure receives one-sixth of the XP that the group earns.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Blaster and Blade I"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dual Weapon Mastery I"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dual_Weapon_Mastery_I","referenceId":"reference:f50ca7ec9196bfe9"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Proficiency (Advanced Melee Weapons)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_(Advanced_Melee_Weapons)"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Proficiency (Pistols)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_(Pistols)"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you make a single attack with an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Advanced Melee Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Advanced_Melee_Weapon"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", you can immediately make an attack with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistol"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistol"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"},", provided you have both the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Advanced Melee Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Advanced_Melee_Weapon"}," and the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistol"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistol"}," in your hands when the melee attack is made. You apply the normal penalties for fighting with two weapons to both of these attacks.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Blaster and Blade II"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Blaster and Blade I"]},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dual Weapon Mastery I"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dual_Weapon_Mastery_I","referenceId":"reference:f50ca7ec9196bfe9"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Proficiency (Advanced Melee Weapons)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_(Advanced_Melee_Weapons)"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Proficiency (Pistols)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_(Pistols)"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you are wielding both an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Advanced Melee Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Advanced_Melee_Weapon"}," and a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistol"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistol"},", you treat the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Advanced Melee Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Advanced_Melee_Weapon"}," as though you were wielding it two-handed (including doubling your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," bonus on damage rolls).\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Blaster and Blade III"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Blaster and Blade I"]},", ",{"tag":"b","children":["Blaster and Blade II"]},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dual Weapon Mastery I"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dual_Weapon_Mastery_I","referenceId":"reference:f50ca7ec9196bfe9"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Proficiency (Advanced Melee Weapons)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_(Advanced_Melee_Weapons)"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Proficiency (Pistols)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_(Pistols)"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you are wielding both an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Advanced Melee Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Advanced_Melee_Weapon"}," and a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistol"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistol"},", you can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full_Attack"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"}," instead of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},", provided you attack with both weapons.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Boarder"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You are skilled at boarding hostile vessels. You ignore ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cover"}," (but not ",{"tag":"a","children":["Improved Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Improved_Cover"},") with your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Character Scale"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Character_Scale"}," ranged attacks while aboard a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Space Station"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Space_Station"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Ion Mastery"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You know the typical weaknesses of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"},", and you know how to preserve such targets for capture rather than destroying them. When attacking with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ion"}," weapons, you gain a +1 bonus on attack rolls and deal +1 die of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ion"}," damage.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Multiattack Proficiency (Advanced Melee Weapons)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you make multiple attacks with any type of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Advanced Melee Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Advanced_Melee_Weapon"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"}," (see ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full_Attack"},"), you reduce the penalty on your attack rolls by 2. You can take this Talent multiple times; each time you take this Talent, you reduce the penalty on your attack rolls by an additional 2.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Preserving Shot"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When you deal damage with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Weapon"}," that is equal to or greater than both the target Vehicle's current ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," and the target Vehicle's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"}," (that is, when you would deal enough damage to destroy the target ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"},"), you can choose to use this Talent. Instead of dealing full damage, you instead deal half damage to your target and move it -1 step along the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},". In addition, you disable the ship's sublight engines and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hyperdrive"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hyperdrive","referenceId":"reference:6774bf610b6e6f09"},". The ship cannot ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move","referenceId":"reference:6ecc3df6bffdd06c"}," or make a jump to lightspeed until it receives repairs.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
